---
title: "Work — Nocturea"
description: "Identities and websites for communities, studios and independent brands. Every project started on a blank page."
active: work
---
<section class="noc-wrap noc-section--hero">
  <p class="noc-eyebrow noc-eyebrow--head">Work</p>
  <h1 class="noc-h1">Three projects, each one started on a blank page.</h1>
  <p class="noc-lead noc-hero-lead">Identities and websites for communities, studios and independent brands. Hover a row to see the work; open it to read why it looks the way it does.</p>
</section>

<section class="noc-wrap noc-work">
  <div class="noc-work-list">
    {{- for project of projects }}
    <a href="{{ project.url }}" class="noc-work-row">
      <span class="noc-work-row__num">{{ project.num }}</span>
      <span>
        <span class="noc-work-row__name">{{ project.name }}</span>
        <span class="noc-work-row__line">{{ project.kind }} — {{ project.client }}</span>
      </span>
      <span class="noc-work-row__year">{{ project.year }}</span>
    </a>
    {{- /for }}
  </div>

  <aside class="noc-work-aside" aria-hidden="true">
    {{- for project of projects }}
    <div class="noc-work-preview">
      <div class="noc-shot noc-shot--4x3"><span>{{ project.shot }}</span></div>
      <p class="noc-work-preview__name">{{ project.name }}</p>
      <p class="noc-body">{{ project.summary }}</p>
    </div>
    {{- /for }}
  </aside>
</section>
